{const c={"id":"geology-remote-spectral-v22","sceneId":"g1","title":"地质剖面遥感解译：多波段比例特征 + 高斯分类","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-01","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"地表岩性在不同波段中可能有不同响应，而光照会整体改变亮度。本例从独立训练样本学习三类光谱比例，再对新图幅逐像素分类；改变照明与噪声，比较多波段学习和原始亮度基线。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"多波段比例特征 + 高斯分类","desc":"实际前端计算，可查看模型与结果"},{"label":"资料","value":"1200 独立光谱样本","desc":"合成教学资料，与测试独立"},{"label":"交互","value":"换样例 / 实时联动","desc":"地图、输入、输出与逐点解释同步"},{"label":"验收","value":"真值 / 基线 / 错误","desc":"指标与错误位置一起看"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"PROBLEM","title":"专业对象与业务问题","html":"<p>区域地质调查为盆地认识和后续物探部署提供地表底图。光谱成像记录不同材料随波段变化的响应；解释员结合地形、露头与地质背景勾绘单元界线。这里的“剖面遥感解译”只演示其中的地表单元分类，不把影像直接当成地下剖面。</p><figure style=\"margin:15px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"地质剖面遥感解译专业概念图\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#faf8f2\"/><g fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"13\"><path d=\"M30 95L85 65L140 105L195 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#41699b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M30 115L85 85L140 125L195 70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"55\">亮度改变：谱线整体移动</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"91\">相对形状：仍可能保留材料线索</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"127\">候选单元 ≠ 地下油藏位置</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">概念示意；数值与图形不代表实际工区成果。</figcaption></figure><p>明暗阴影可能让同一种岩石看上去不同，而两种岩石也可能在单波段中相似。逐像素目视勾绘费时，边界存在解释差异；植被和覆盖层还可能遮挡真实岩性。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"METHOD","title":"智能化方法如何介入","html":"<p>设输入为三个正反射率代理 r，先计算 rᵢ/Σr，降低共同照明倍率的影响。高斯分类器从三类独立样本学习每个比例的均值和方差，计算类别分数并选择最高类。伪彩色图只是三个代理通道的可视编码，不是真实卫星影像。</p><figure style=\"margin:16px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 135\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"光照整体缩放，多波段比例保留，学习已知类分布，候选图层需复核\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">01</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">光照整体缩放</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee9db\"/><text x=\"201\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">02</text><text x=\"201\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">多波段比例保留</text><rect x=\"366\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e4ebf1\"/><text x=\"377\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">03</text><text x=\"377\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">学习已知类分布</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f3e5da\"/><text x=\"553\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">04</text><text x=\"553\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">候选图层需复核</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">概念关系示意：输入证据、方法与地质解释分开核对。</figcaption></figure><p>三类准确率、宏平均 F1、错误像素和混淆矩阵；右图可切换真值/错误。点击像素或移动坐标滑杆，核对三波段输入、比例、类别分数和所在横截线。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"资料、标注与独立验证","html":"<p>训练：每类 400 个独立合成光谱样本，训练种子固定。测试：80×60 像素的新图幅，换图会改变单元界线、地表起伏响应和噪声纹理；同图滑动只改变照明倍率与噪声幅度，不重新抽样。真实资料应统一传感器、波段、大气校正与空间分辨率，用独立区块或图幅验证。</p><p>训练与测试分开生成；真值只用于验收和对照显示，不进入当前测试样例的模型评分、追踪或投票。演示在浏览器中直接运行实际数值计算，未使用后端。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"REVIEW","title":"解释边界与参考方向","html":"<p>仅合成地表三类光谱代理；不处理植被、完整大气效应、构造线和真实地质剖面重建。地表候选不等于地下圈闭或含油性；比例特征也不能消除所有跨区差异。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.usgs.gov/labs/spectroscopy-lab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USGS：光谱遥感与材料识别</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/naive_bayes.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">官方：高斯朴素贝叶斯</a>。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"地质剖面遥感解译：从资料到可复核的候选结果","lead":["地表岩性在不同波段中可能有不同响应，而光照会整体改变亮度。本例从独立训练样本学习三类光谱比例，再对新图幅逐像素分类；改变照明与噪声，比较多波段学习和原始亮度基线。"],"stats":[["训练与测试","独立样例"],["计算","纯前端"],["验证","基线 + 错误定位"]],"steps":[{"name":"准备独立图幅与标签","role":"资料准备","do":"规范波段、分辨率和地表单元标签。本例合成三类训练样本和独立测试图，不将测试边界用于训练。 **三波段输入 → 地表单元标签**","effect":"三波段输入 → 地表单元标签","trap":"相邻像素随机拆分会高估跨图幅效果。"},{"name":"学习光谱比例分布","role":"模型学习","do":"将每个像素归一化为三个波段比例，按类估计均值、方差；小方差设下限，模型之后固定。 **反射率 → 比例 → 三类统计量**","effect":"反射率 → 比例 → 三类统计量","trap":"比例特征不是对所有地表条件都不变。"},{"name":"逐像素生成候选图","role":"独立推理","do":"仅从当前影像计算比例及类别分数；同时计算不归一化的最近原型基线。 **当前输入 → 分类色带 / 基线**","effect":"当前输入 → 分类色带 / 基线","trap":"分类器不读取测试真值，也不直接定位油藏。"},{"name":"核查混淆与边界","role":"可视复核","do":"切换真值与错误图，查混淆矩阵并逐像素读数，导出全部像素记录。 **真值对照 → 错误位置 → 人工复核**","effect":"真值对照 → 错误位置 → 人工复核","trap":"高分只代表本例简化分布，不能视为现场精度。"}],"metrics":{"title":"用什么判断做得好","html":"<figure style=\"margin:16px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 135\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"准备独立图幅与标签，学习光谱比例分布，逐像素生成候选图，核查混淆与边界\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">01</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">准备独立图幅与标签</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee9db\"/><text x=\"201\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">02</text><text x=\"201\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">学习光谱比例分布</text><rect x=\"366\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e4ebf1\"/><text x=\"377\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">03</text><text x=\"377\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">逐像素生成候选图</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f3e5da\"/><text x=\"553\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">04</text><text x=\"553\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">核查混淆与边界</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">工序链：每步都有输入、可见结果和需要复核的误差。</figcaption></figure><p>三类准确率、宏平均 F1、错误像素和混淆矩阵；右图可切换真值/错误。点击像素或移动坐标滑杆，核对三波段输入、比例、类别分数和所在横截线。</p><p>仅合成地表三类光谱代理；不处理植被、完整大气效应、构造线和真实地质剖面重建。地表候选不等于地下圈闭或含油性；比例特征也不能消除所有跨区差异。</p>"},"fails":[{"name":"覆盖层干扰","why":"植被、风化和阴影可能破坏光谱与单元的对应。"},{"name":"高权重误判","why":"未校准模型权重不能解释为现场正确概率。"},{"name":"地表地下混淆","why":"分类图应与地形、露头和物探联合复核。"}]},"demo":{"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"地表岩性在不同波段中可能有不同响应，而光照会整体改变亮度。本例从独立训练样本学习三类光谱比例，再对新图幅逐像素分类；改变照明与噪声，比较多波段学习和原始亮度基线。","height":780}}},demo={"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"地表岩性在不同波段中可能有不同响应，而光照会整体改变亮度。本例从独立训练样本学习三类光谱比例，再对新图幅逐像素分类；改变照明与噪声，比较多波段学习和原始亮度基线。","height":780},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":3853,"mime":"text/html","enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>地质剖面遥感解译 · v2.2</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\" id=\"sample-name\">独立合成测试样例</span><h1>同一地质单元，亮一点就会变成另一类吗？</h1><p class=\"lead\">地表岩性在不同波段中可能有不同响应，而光照会整体改变亮度。本例从独立训练样本学习三类光谱比例，再对新图幅逐像素分类；改变照明与噪声，比较多波段学习和原始亮度基线。</p></div><button id=\"new-sample\" class=\"btn primary\" type=\"button\">换一幅影像 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"noise\">观测噪声 <output id=\"out-noise\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1.5\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.45\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"param\">地表照明倍率 <output id=\"out-param\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.45\" max=\"1.5\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.7\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts\" aria-label=\"输入、模型与可视分析\"><div class=\"map-tools\"><label for=\"view-mode\">右图显示</label><select id=\"view-mode\"><option value=\"pred\">模型预测</option><option value=\"truth\">合成真值（验收）</option><option value=\"error\">错误位置</option></select><span>点击任一地图，联动逐点解释</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span style=\"color:#bc9457\">■ 砂质单元</span><span style=\"color:#6d8a72\">■ 泥质单元</span><span style=\"color:#7395b6\">■ 碳酸盐单元</span></div><div class=\"image-pair\"><figure><figcaption>多波段伪彩色代理（NIR / SWIR1 / SWIR2）</figcaption><canvas id=\"raw-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"330\" aria-label=\"多波段伪彩色代理（NIR / SWIR1 / SWIR2）\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>地表单元候选分类（可切换真值/错误）</figcaption><canvas id=\"mask-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"330\" aria-label=\"地表单元候选分类\"></canvas></figure></div><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 205\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"三波段横截线\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div class=\"readouts\"><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml0\"></span><b id=\"m0\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml1\"></span><b id=\"m1\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml2\"></span><b id=\"m2\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml3\"></span><b id=\"m3\">—</b></div></div><p id=\"note\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：输入、判断与依据</h2><span id=\"point-location\"></span></div><div class=\"coordinates\"><label for=\"point-x\">横坐标<input id=\"point-x\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"79\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label><label for=\"point-y\">纵坐标<input id=\"point-y\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"59\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label></div><div class=\"point-values\" id=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型、训练与本次结果明细</summary><p>多波段比例特征 + 高斯分类；1200 独立光谱样本，独立于当前测试影像。</p><div id=\"coefficients\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"export\" type=\"button\">导出本次 CSV</button><span>同样例滑动不重抽数据；更换样例不改变训练模型。</span></div><p class=\"note\">仅合成地表三类光谱代理；不处理植被、完整大气效应、构造线和真实地质剖面重建。地表候选不等于地下圈闭或含油性；比例特征也不能消除所有跨区差异。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":8463,"mime":"text/css","enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.image-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.image-pair figure{margin:0;min-width:0}.image-pair figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px;min-height:32px}.image-pair canvas{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:#fff}.map-tools{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:11px}.map-tools select{font:inherit;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px;color:var(--jade);border-radius:5px}#diagnostic{margin-top:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:#fff}.demo-results table{font-size:10px;table-layout:auto}.demo-results th,.demo-results td{padding:5px 4px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}.demo-charts .legend{font-size:10px}canvas{cursor:crosshair;touch-action:manipulation}.coordinates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:10px 0}.coordinates label{white-space:nowrap;font-size:11px;display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:center}.coordinates input{min-width:0;width:100%;accent-color:var(--jade)}.demo-results .note{line-height:1.85}@media(max-width:560px){.image-pair{gap:6px}.image-pair figcaption{font-size:10px}.demo-head>div{min-width:180px}}"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":9329,"mime":"text/javascript","enc":"text","data":"(function(){\nconst SPEC={\"key\":\"remote\",\"w\":80,\"h\":60,\"scale\":1,\"axis\":\"图像像素 x → / y ↓\",\"noise\":0.45,\"value\":0.7,\"sample\":\"影像\",\"digits\":2,\"binary\":false};\n'use strict';\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x)),avg=a=>a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/a.length;\nfunction rng(seed){return()=>{seed=(Math.imul(seed,1664525)+1013904223)>>>0;return seed/4294967296}}\nconst unitNames=['砂质单元','泥质单元','碳酸盐单元','断层线候选'],unitColors=['#bc9457','#6d8a72','#7395b6','#ba5448'];\nfunction f1(a,b){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;for(let i=0;i<a.length;i++){if(a[i]&&b[i])tp++;else if(a[i])fp++;else if(b[i])fn++}return{tp,fp,fn,f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),precision:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fp),recall:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fn)}}\nfunction table(headers,rows){return '<table><tr>'+headers.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.map(r=>'<tr>'+r.map(v=>'<td>'+v+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>'}\nfunction metrics(a){a.forEach(([k,v],i)=>{$('ml'+i).textContent=k;$('m'+i).textContent=v})}\nfunction pointValues(a,text){$('point-values').innerHTML=a.map(([k,v])=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+v+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=text}\nconst CW=400,CH=330,OX=40,OY=15,PW=348,PH=276;\nfunction plot(id,color){let g=$(id).getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,CW,CH);for(let y=0;y<SPEC.h;y++)for(let x=0;x<SPEC.w;x++){g.fillStyle=color(y*SPEC.w+x);g.fillRect(OX+x*PW/SPEC.w,OY+y*PH/SPEC.h,PW/SPEC.w+.4,PH/SPEC.h+.4)}g.fillStyle='#79828a';g.font='10px sans-serif';for(let t of [0,.5,1]){g.fillText((t*(SPEC.w-1)*SPEC.scale).toFixed(1),OX+t*PW-8,CH-23);g.fillText((t*(SPEC.h-1)*SPEC.scale).toFixed(1),2,OY+t*PH+3)}g.fillText(SPEC.axis,OX,CH-6);g.strokeStyle='#b26a39';g.lineWidth=1;let x=OX+(selected.x+.5)*PW/SPEC.w,y=OY+(selected.y+.5)*PH/SPEC.h;g.beginPath();g.moveTo(x-7,y);g.lineTo(x+7,y);g.moveTo(x,y-7);g.lineTo(x,y+7);g.stroke();return g}\nconst rgb=a=>'rgb('+a.map(v=>Math.round(clamp(v,0,1)*255)).join(',')+')';\nfunction outputColor(i){let mode=$('view-mode').value,p=result.pred[i],t=well.truth[i];if(mode==='truth')return t<0?'#f3f1e9':SPEC.binary?(t?'#2f7d6b':'#f3f1e9'):unitColors[t];if(mode==='error')return p===t?'#e5efe8':p<0?'#c9c6c1':SPEC.binary?(p?'#b26a39':'#41699b'):'#ba5448';return p<0?'#e8e5db':SPEC.binary?(p?'#2f7d6b':'#f3f1e9'):unitColors[p]}\nfunction svgText(x,y,s,color='#79828a',size=11){return '<text x=\"'+x+'\" y=\"'+y+'\" fill=\"'+color+'\" font-size=\"'+size+'\">'+s+'</text>'}\nfunction linePath(a,lo,hi,top=22,height=125){return a.map((v,i)=>(i?'L':'M')+(48+i/Math.max(1,a.length-1)*636).toFixed(1)+' '+(top+(hi-v)/(hi-lo)*height).toFixed(1)).join('')}\nfunction curve(a,lo,hi,color,top=22,height=125){return '<path d=\"'+linePath(a,lo,hi,top,height)+'\" stroke=\"'+color+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>'}\nfunction chartGrid(lo,hi,label){let s=svgText(48,13,label,'#4d565b');for(let k=0;k<3;k++){let y=22+k*62.5;s+='<line x1=\"48\" y1=\"'+y+'\" x2=\"684\" y2=\"'+y+'\" stroke=\"#e9e5dc\"/>'+svgText(3,y+4,(hi-(hi-lo)*k/2).toFixed(1))}return s}\nlet sampleIndex=0,well=null,result=null,pending=0,selected={x:Math.floor(SPEC.w*.55),y:Math.floor(SPEC.h*.55)};\nfunction refresh(){let n=+$('noise').value,p=+$('param').value;$('out-noise').textContent=n.toFixed(2);$('out-param').textContent=SPEC.percent?(p*100).toFixed(0)+'%':p.toFixed(SPEC.digits??2);$('sample-name').textContent='独立合成'+SPEC.sample+' '+String(sampleIndex+1).padStart(3,'0')+' · 种子 '+well.seed;result=compute(well,n,p);render();inspect()}\nfunction flush(){if(pending){cancelAnimationFrame(pending);pending=0}refresh()}\nfunction schedule(){if(!pending)pending=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{pending=0;refresh()})}\nfunction initialize(){well=makeWell(12031);for(let id of ['noise','param']){$(id).addEventListener('input',schedule);$(id).addEventListener('change',flush)}$('new-sample').addEventListener('click',()=>{well=makeWell(12031+7919*++sampleIndex);flush()});$('reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{sampleIndex=0;well=makeWell(12031);$('noise').value=SPEC.noise;$('param').value=SPEC.value;selected={x:Math.floor(SPEC.w*.55),y:Math.floor(SPEC.h*.55)};flush()});for(let id of ['raw-image','mask-image'])$(id).addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$(id).getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*CW,y=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*CH;selected={x:Math.floor(clamp((x-OX)/PW*SPEC.w,0,SPEC.w-1)),y:Math.floor(clamp((y-OY)/PH*SPEC.h,0,SPEC.h-1))};render();inspect()});$('view-mode').addEventListener('change',()=>{render();inspect()});$('point-x').max=SPEC.w-1;$('point-y').max=SPEC.h-1;for(let id of ['point-x','point-y'])$(id).addEventListener('input',()=>{selected={x:+$('point-x').value,y:+$('point-y').value};render();inspect()});$('export').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(pending)flush();let c=csvRows(),quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[c.head,...c.rows].map(r=>r.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download=SPEC.key+'-'+well.seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)});refresh()}\nfunction position(){let i=selected.y*SPEC.w+selected.x;$('point-x').value=selected.x;$('point-y').value=selected.y;$('point-location').textContent='('+selected.x+', '+selected.y+')';return i}\n\nconst spectra=[[.35,.48,.28],[.26,.30,.42],[.48,.38,.27]],ratio=x=>{let s=x.reduce((a,v)=>a+v,0);return x.map(v=>v/Math.max(.001,s))};\nconst training=(()=>{let a=[],r=rng(771);for(let k=0;k<3;k++)for(let j=0;j<400;j++){let illumination=.55+r()*.8,x=spectra[k].map(v=>v*illumination+(r()+r()-1)*.035);a.push({x:ratio(x),label:k})}return a})();\nconst model=spectra.map((_,k)=>{let d=training.filter(v=>v.label===k);let mean=[0,1,2].map(j=>avg(d.map(v=>v.x[j]))),variance=mean.map((v,j)=>Math.max(.0001,avg(d.map(x=>(x.x[j]-v)**2))));return{mean,variance}});\nfunction classify(x){let score=model.map(m=>-.5*x.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+Math.log(m.variance[j])+(v-m.mean[j])**2/m.variance[j],0)),max=Math.max(...score),weights=score.map(v=>Math.exp(v-max)),sum=weights.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0);return{label:score.indexOf(max),weights:weights.map(v=>v/sum)}}\nfunction makeWell(seed){let r=rng(seed),a=18+r()*8,b=45+r()*9,phase=r()*6,truth=[],raw=[],noise=[];for(let y=0;y<SPEC.h;y++)for(let x=0;x<SPEC.w;x++){let shift=5*Math.sin(y/12+phase),k=x<a+shift?0:x<b+shift?1:2;truth.push(k);raw.push(spectra[k].map(v=>v*(.93+.12*Math.sin((x+y)/15))+(r()-.5)*.018));noise.push([r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1])}return{seed,truth,raw,noise}}\nfunction compute(w,nl,illumination){let raw=w.raw.map((a,i)=>a.map((v,j)=>clamp(v*illumination+w.noise[i][j]*nl*.13,.01,1))),features=raw.map(ratio),all=features.map(classify),pred=all.map(v=>v.label),base=raw.map(a=>{let ds=spectra.map(b=>b.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+(v-a[j])**2,0));return ds.indexOf(Math.min(...ds))}),matrix=Array.from({length:3},()=>[0,0,0]);pred.forEach((v,i)=>matrix[w.truth[i]][v]++);let accuracy=a=>100*a.filter((v,i)=>v===w.truth[i]).length/a.length,macro=avg(matrix.map((row,k)=>2*row[k]/Math.max(1,row.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)+matrix.reduce((s,v)=>s+v[k],0))));return{raw,features,all,pred,base,matrix,accuracy:accuracy(pred),baseline:accuracy(base),macro}}\nfunction render(){let d=result;plot('raw-image',i=>rgb(d.raw[i]));plot('mask-image',outputColor);let start=selected.y*SPEC.w,a=d.raw.slice(start,start+SPEC.w);$('diagnostic').innerHTML=chartGrid(0,1,'所选横截线：三波段反射率代理')+[0,1,2].map((j)=>curve(a.map(v=>v[j]),0,1,['#41699b','#b26a39','#2f7d6b'][j])).join('')+svgText(48,177,'横向像素 →    蓝 NIR / 棕 SWIR1 / 绿 SWIR2；这不是真实传感器标定值');metrics([['多波段准确率',d.accuracy.toFixed(1)+'%'],['未归一化基线',d.baseline.toFixed(1)+'%'],['宏平均 F1',d.macro.toFixed(3)],['错误像素',String(d.pred.filter((v,i)=>v!==well.truth[i]).length)]]);$('note').innerHTML='亮度变化会改变原始反射率代理，却可能保留波段比例。学习分类在归一化后工作；把噪声调高，观察边界与类别混淆。右图可切换<b>合成真值 / 错误位置</b>。';$('coefficients').innerHTML=table(['训练类','NIR 比例均值','SWIR1','SWIR2'],model.map((m,k)=>[unitNames[k],...m.mean.map(v=>v.toFixed(3))]))+table(['真值 / 预测',...unitNames.slice(0,3)],d.matrix.map((r,k)=>[unitNames[k],...r]));}\nfunction inspect(){let i=position(),d=result;pointValues([['输入三波段',d.raw[i].map(v=>v.toFixed(3)).join(' / ')],['归一化比例',d.features[i].map(v=>v.toFixed(3)).join(' / ')],['真值 / 模型',unitNames[well.truth[i]]+' / '+unitNames[d.pred[i]]],['三类模型权重',d.all[i].weights.map(v=>v.toFixed(2)).join(' / ')]],'点击两幅图或移动坐标滑杆，联动查看该像素与横截线。模型使用固定训练统计量，不读取测试单元边界。权重未经概率校准；光谱代理不包含植被、覆盖层或真实大气效应，地表单元分类不能直接推断地下圈闭或含油性。')}\nfunction csvRows(){return{head:['sample_seed','x_px','y_px','NIR_proxy','SWIR1_proxy','SWIR2_proxy','truth_class','predicted_class','raw_baseline_class','weight_sand','weight_shale','weight_carbonate'],rows:result.raw.map((a,i)=>[well.seed,i%SPEC.w,Math.floor(i/SPEC.w),...a,well.truth[i],result.pred[i],result.base[i],...result.all[i].weights])}}\ninitialize();\n\n})();"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){const host=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>host.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"geology-geochem-covariance-v22","sceneId":"g2","title":"油气地球化学异常识别：背景协方差学习 + 马氏距离","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-01","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"地表化探需要联合判断指标，单个高值可能来自污染。本例从独立背景样本学习双指标相关关系，用马氏距离圈出待复核点；地图、双指标散点与误报漏报实时联动。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"背景协方差学习 + 马氏距离","desc":"实际前端计算，可查看模型与结果"},{"label":"资料","value":"600 独立背景样本","desc":"合成教学资料，与测试独立"},{"label":"交互","value":"换样例 / 实时联动","desc":"地图、输入、输出与逐点解释同步"},{"label":"验收","value":"真值 / 基线 / 错误","desc":"指标与错误位置一起看"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"PROBLEM","title":"专业对象与业务问题","html":"<p>油气微渗漏可能在地表土壤化学指标中留下线索。区域调查布置采样点、化验多项指标，再结合地质与污染背景解释异常。化探是部署复查的辅助信息，异常与地下油气之间并非一一对应。</p><figure style=\"margin:15px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"油气地球化学异常识别专业概念图\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#faf8f2\"/><g fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"13\"><ellipse cx=\"120\" cy=\"80\" rx=\"85\" ry=\"25\" transform=\"rotate(-25 120 80)\" fill=\"#e5efe8\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"155\" cy=\"33\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"63\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"55\">沿背景相关方向的高值：可能仍正常</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"91\">偏离相关关系的点：值得复查</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"127\">污染也会异常，不能直接判油气</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">概念示意；数值与图形不代表实际工区成果。</figcaption></figure><p>逐项设阈值忽略指标之间的正常相关性。某一点绝对值不高，却可能明显偏离背景组合；地表污染也可能表现为强异常。简单把高值连成“靶区概率”会掩盖不确定性。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"METHOD","title":"智能化方法如何介入","html":"<p>先用独立背景样本估计均值 μ 和正则化协方差 Σ。马氏距离 D = √((x−μ)ᵀΣ⁻¹(x−μ))，考虑各指标尺度与相关性；D 超过当前阈值即标记待复核。它没有学习“有油/无油”标签，不输出油气概率。</p><figure style=\"margin:16px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 135\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"相关背景呈椭圆，偏离关系也异常，阈值平衡漏误报，异常需要地质复查\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">01</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">相关背景呈椭圆</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee9db\"/><text x=\"201\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">02</text><text x=\"201\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">偏离关系也异常</text><rect x=\"366\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e4ebf1\"/><text x=\"377\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">03</text><text x=\"377\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">阈值平衡漏误报</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f3e5da\"/><text x=\"553\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">04</text><text x=\"553\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">异常需要地质复查</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">概念关系示意：输入证据、方法与地质解释分开核对。</figcaption></figure><p>组合异常 F1、单指标 B>1.9 基线、误报/漏报和待复核数量。左图为每个采样点的距离，未插值或聚类；散点图中的椭圆显示阈值，黑点定位选中的采样位置。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"资料、标注与独立验证","html":"<p>训练为 600 个独立合成背景样本；测试为 24×20 个规则采样点，每格 0.5 km。合成目标区与左上污染区只作验收标签。换区改变目标位置与化验值；背景模型固定。真实验证需按空间区块留出，并审查背景样本是否被异常污染。</p><p>训练与测试分开生成；真值只用于验收和对照显示，不进入当前测试样例的模型评分、追踪或投票。演示在浏览器中直接运行实际数值计算，未使用后端。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"REVIEW","title":"解释边界与参考方向","html":"<p>指标为无量纲合成代理，示范背景相关性与污染误报。没有地统计插值、空间聚类、现场概率校准或油气靶区结论；不能根据一张异常图证明地下存在油气。</p><p><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/auto_examples/covariance/plot_mahalanobis_distances.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">官方：协方差与马氏距离</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/outlier_detection.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">官方：异常与新颖性检测</a>。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"油气地球化学异常识别：从资料到可复核的候选结果","lead":["地表化探需要联合判断指标，单个高值可能来自污染。本例从独立背景样本学习双指标相关关系，用马氏距离圈出待复核点；地图、双指标散点与误报漏报实时联动。"],"stats":[["训练与测试","独立样例"],["计算","纯前端"],["验证","基线 + 错误定位"]],"steps":[{"name":"先查采样与背景","role":"资料准备","do":"检查坐标、单位、化验批次、地表污染与季节。本例将训练背景和测试区分开生成。 **采样位置 / 指标 → 合格背景集**","effect":"采样位置 / 指标 → 合格背景集","trap":"用含异常的全区重新拟合背景可能掩盖目标。"},{"name":"学习正常组合关系","role":"模型学习","do":"计算双指标均值与协方差，并加对角正则项避免逆矩阵不稳定。 **背景点云 → 均值 / 协方差椭圆**","effect":"背景点云 → 均值 / 协方差椭圆","trap":"普通协方差仍会受异常训练点影响，本例背景是干净合成样本。"},{"name":"评分并筛选待复核点","role":"独立推理","do":"逐点计算马氏距离，随阈值更新异常掩膜；单 B 阈值提供对照。 **化验值 → 距离 → 阈值判别**","effect":"化验值 → 距离 → 阈值判别","trap":"阈值不是油气出现概率；污染也会触发异常。"},{"name":"地图与散点联合复核","role":"可视复核","do":"切换错误图，点击污染或目标点看距离、指标和标签；导出全区结果供后续解释。 **异常地图 ↔ 组合散点 ↔ 逐点记录**","effect":"异常地图 ↔ 组合散点 ↔ 逐点记录","trap":"F1 依赖教学真值，现场还需复采与地质证据。"}],"metrics":{"title":"用什么判断做得好","html":"<figure style=\"margin:16px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 135\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"先查采样与背景，学习正常组合关系，评分并筛选待复核点，地图与散点联合复核\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">01</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">先查采样与背景</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee9db\"/><text x=\"201\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">02</text><text x=\"201\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">学习正常组合关系</text><rect x=\"366\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e4ebf1\"/><text x=\"377\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">03</text><text x=\"377\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">评分并筛选待复核点</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f3e5da\"/><text x=\"553\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">04</text><text x=\"553\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">地图与散点联合复核</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">工序链：每步都有输入、可见结果和需要复核的误差。</figcaption></figure><p>组合异常 F1、单指标 B>1.9 基线、误报/漏报和待复核数量。左图为每个采样点的距离，未插值或聚类；散点图中的椭圆显示阈值，黑点定位选中的采样位置。</p><p>指标为无量纲合成代理，示范背景相关性与污染误报。没有地统计插值、空间聚类、现场概率校准或油气靶区结论；不能根据一张异常图证明地下存在油气。</p>"},"fails":[{"name":"污染误报","why":"与背景不同并不等于油气微渗漏。"},{"name":"背景选择错误","why":"训练背景偏移会使全区评分失准。"},{"name":"空间泄漏","why":"邻近采样点随机拆分无法检验跨区域泛化。"}]},"demo":{"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"地表化探需要联合判断指标，单个高值可能来自污染。本例从独立背景样本学习双指标相关关系，用马氏距离圈出待复核点；地图、双指标散点与误报漏报实时联动。","height":780}}},demo={"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"地表化探需要联合判断指标，单个高值可能来自污染。本例从独立背景样本学习双指标相关关系，用马氏距离圈出待复核点；地图、双指标散点与误报漏报实时联动。","height":780},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":3864,"mime":"text/html","enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>油气地球化学异常识别 · v2.2</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\" id=\"sample-name\">独立合成测试样例</span><h1>指标不算最高，却偏离了正常的组合关系</h1><p class=\"lead\">地表化探需要联合判断指标，单个高值可能来自污染。本例从独立背景样本学习双指标相关关系，用马氏距离圈出待复核点；地图、双指标散点与误报漏报实时联动。</p></div><button id=\"new-sample\" class=\"btn primary\" type=\"button\">换一个采样区 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"noise\">观测噪声 <output id=\"out-noise\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1.5\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.35\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"param\">马氏距离阈值 <output id=\"out-param\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"7\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"3\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts\" aria-label=\"输入、模型与可视分析\"><div class=\"map-tools\"><label for=\"view-mode\">右图显示</label><select id=\"view-mode\"><option value=\"pred\">模型预测</option><option value=\"truth\">合成真值（验收）</option><option value=\"error\">错误位置</option></select><span>点击任一地图，联动逐点解释</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span style=\"color:#2f7d6b\">■ 预测异常</span><span style=\"color:#b26a39\">■ 误报</span><span style=\"color:#41699b\">■ 漏报</span><span>错误模式中浅绿为一致</span></div><div class=\"image-pair\"><figure><figcaption>偏离背景的程度（深色较大，无插值）</figcaption><canvas id=\"raw-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"330\" aria-label=\"偏离背景的程度（深色较大，无插值）\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>组合异常判别（可切换真值/错误）</figcaption><canvas id=\"mask-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"330\" aria-label=\"组合异常判别\"></canvas></figure></div><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 205\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"双指标散点与背景阈值椭圆\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div class=\"readouts\"><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml0\"></span><b id=\"m0\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml1\"></span><b id=\"m1\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml2\"></span><b id=\"m2\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml3\"></span><b id=\"m3\">—</b></div></div><p id=\"note\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：输入、判断与依据</h2><span id=\"point-location\"></span></div><div class=\"coordinates\"><label for=\"point-x\">横坐标<input id=\"point-x\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"79\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label><label for=\"point-y\">纵坐标<input id=\"point-y\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"59\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label></div><div class=\"point-values\" id=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型、训练与本次结果明细</summary><p>背景协方差学习 + 马氏距离；600 独立背景样本，独立于当前测试采样区。</p><div id=\"coefficients\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"export\" type=\"button\">导出本次 CSV</button><span>同样例滑动不重抽数据；更换样例不改变训练模型。</span></div><p class=\"note\">指标为无量纲合成代理，示范背景相关性与污染误报。没有地统计插值、空间聚类、现场概率校准或油气靶区结论；不能根据一张异常图证明地下存在油气。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":8463,"mime":"text/css","enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.image-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.image-pair figure{margin:0;min-width:0}.image-pair figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px;min-height:32px}.image-pair canvas{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:#fff}.map-tools{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:11px}.map-tools select{font:inherit;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px;color:var(--jade);border-radius:5px}#diagnostic{margin-top:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:#fff}.demo-results table{font-size:10px;table-layout:auto}.demo-results th,.demo-results td{padding:5px 4px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}.demo-charts .legend{font-size:10px}canvas{cursor:crosshair;touch-action:manipulation}.coordinates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:10px 0}.coordinates label{white-space:nowrap;font-size:11px;display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:center}.coordinates input{min-width:0;width:100%;accent-color:var(--jade)}.demo-results .note{line-height:1.85}@media(max-width:560px){.image-pair{gap:6px}.image-pair figcaption{font-size:10px}.demo-head>div{min-width:180px}}"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":10208,"mime":"text/javascript","enc":"text","data":"(function(){\nconst SPEC={\"key\":\"geochem\",\"w\":24,\"h\":20,\"scale\":0.5,\"axis\":\"教学网格，km；每格一个采样点\",\"noise\":0.35,\"value\":3,\"sample\":\"采样区\",\"digits\":1,\"binary\":true};\n'use strict';\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x)),avg=a=>a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/a.length;\nfunction rng(seed){return()=>{seed=(Math.imul(seed,1664525)+1013904223)>>>0;return seed/4294967296}}\nconst unitNames=['砂质单元','泥质单元','碳酸盐单元','断层线候选'],unitColors=['#bc9457','#6d8a72','#7395b6','#ba5448'];\nfunction f1(a,b){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;for(let i=0;i<a.length;i++){if(a[i]&&b[i])tp++;else if(a[i])fp++;else if(b[i])fn++}return{tp,fp,fn,f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),precision:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fp),recall:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fn)}}\nfunction table(headers,rows){return '<table><tr>'+headers.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.map(r=>'<tr>'+r.map(v=>'<td>'+v+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>'}\nfunction metrics(a){a.forEach(([k,v],i)=>{$('ml'+i).textContent=k;$('m'+i).textContent=v})}\nfunction pointValues(a,text){$('point-values').innerHTML=a.map(([k,v])=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+v+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=text}\nconst CW=400,CH=330,OX=40,OY=15,PW=348,PH=276;\nfunction plot(id,color){let g=$(id).getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,CW,CH);for(let y=0;y<SPEC.h;y++)for(let x=0;x<SPEC.w;x++){g.fillStyle=color(y*SPEC.w+x);g.fillRect(OX+x*PW/SPEC.w,OY+y*PH/SPEC.h,PW/SPEC.w+.4,PH/SPEC.h+.4)}g.fillStyle='#79828a';g.font='10px sans-serif';for(let t of [0,.5,1]){g.fillText((t*(SPEC.w-1)*SPEC.scale).toFixed(1),OX+t*PW-8,CH-23);g.fillText((t*(SPEC.h-1)*SPEC.scale).toFixed(1),2,OY+t*PH+3)}g.fillText(SPEC.axis,OX,CH-6);g.strokeStyle='#b26a39';g.lineWidth=1;let x=OX+(selected.x+.5)*PW/SPEC.w,y=OY+(selected.y+.5)*PH/SPEC.h;g.beginPath();g.moveTo(x-7,y);g.lineTo(x+7,y);g.moveTo(x,y-7);g.lineTo(x,y+7);g.stroke();return g}\nconst rgb=a=>'rgb('+a.map(v=>Math.round(clamp(v,0,1)*255)).join(',')+')';\nfunction outputColor(i){let mode=$('view-mode').value,p=result.pred[i],t=well.truth[i];if(mode==='truth')return t<0?'#f3f1e9':SPEC.binary?(t?'#2f7d6b':'#f3f1e9'):unitColors[t];if(mode==='error')return p===t?'#e5efe8':p<0?'#c9c6c1':SPEC.binary?(p?'#b26a39':'#41699b'):'#ba5448';return p<0?'#e8e5db':SPEC.binary?(p?'#2f7d6b':'#f3f1e9'):unitColors[p]}\nfunction svgText(x,y,s,color='#79828a',size=11){return '<text x=\"'+x+'\" y=\"'+y+'\" fill=\"'+color+'\" font-size=\"'+size+'\">'+s+'</text>'}\nfunction linePath(a,lo,hi,top=22,height=125){return a.map((v,i)=>(i?'L':'M')+(48+i/Math.max(1,a.length-1)*636).toFixed(1)+' '+(top+(hi-v)/(hi-lo)*height).toFixed(1)).join('')}\nfunction curve(a,lo,hi,color,top=22,height=125){return '<path d=\"'+linePath(a,lo,hi,top,height)+'\" stroke=\"'+color+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>'}\nfunction chartGrid(lo,hi,label){let s=svgText(48,13,label,'#4d565b');for(let k=0;k<3;k++){let y=22+k*62.5;s+='<line x1=\"48\" y1=\"'+y+'\" x2=\"684\" y2=\"'+y+'\" stroke=\"#e9e5dc\"/>'+svgText(3,y+4,(hi-(hi-lo)*k/2).toFixed(1))}return s}\nlet sampleIndex=0,well=null,result=null,pending=0,selected={x:Math.floor(SPEC.w*.55),y:Math.floor(SPEC.h*.55)};\nfunction refresh(){let n=+$('noise').value,p=+$('param').value;$('out-noise').textContent=n.toFixed(2);$('out-param').textContent=SPEC.percent?(p*100).toFixed(0)+'%':p.toFixed(SPEC.digits??2);$('sample-name').textContent='独立合成'+SPEC.sample+' '+String(sampleIndex+1).padStart(3,'0')+' · 种子 '+well.seed;result=compute(well,n,p);render();inspect()}\nfunction flush(){if(pending){cancelAnimationFrame(pending);pending=0}refresh()}\nfunction schedule(){if(!pending)pending=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{pending=0;refresh()})}\nfunction initialize(){well=makeWell(12031);for(let id of ['noise','param']){$(id).addEventListener('input',schedule);$(id).addEventListener('change',flush)}$('new-sample').addEventListener('click',()=>{well=makeWell(12031+7919*++sampleIndex);flush()});$('reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{sampleIndex=0;well=makeWell(12031);$('noise').value=SPEC.noise;$('param').value=SPEC.value;selected={x:Math.floor(SPEC.w*.55),y:Math.floor(SPEC.h*.55)};flush()});for(let id of ['raw-image','mask-image'])$(id).addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$(id).getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*CW,y=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*CH;selected={x:Math.floor(clamp((x-OX)/PW*SPEC.w,0,SPEC.w-1)),y:Math.floor(clamp((y-OY)/PH*SPEC.h,0,SPEC.h-1))};render();inspect()});$('view-mode').addEventListener('change',()=>{render();inspect()});$('point-x').max=SPEC.w-1;$('point-y').max=SPEC.h-1;for(let id of ['point-x','point-y'])$(id).addEventListener('input',()=>{selected={x:+$('point-x').value,y:+$('point-y').value};render();inspect()});$('export').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(pending)flush();let c=csvRows(),quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[c.head,...c.rows].map(r=>r.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download=SPEC.key+'-'+well.seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)});refresh()}\nfunction position(){let i=selected.y*SPEC.w+selected.x;$('point-x').value=selected.x;$('point-y').value=selected.y;$('point-location').textContent='('+selected.x+', '+selected.y+')';return i}\n\nconst training=(()=>{let r=rng(5071);return Array.from({length:600},()=>{let t=r()+r()-1;return[1.5+t*.5,1.4+t*.4+(r()+r()-1)*.09]})})();\nconst model=(()=>{let mean=[0,1].map(j=>avg(training.map(v=>v[j]))),cov=[[0,0],[0,0]];for(let v of training)for(let i=0;i<2;i++)for(let j=0;j<2;j++)cov[i][j]+=(v[i]-mean[i])*(v[j]-mean[j])/training.length;cov[0][0]+=.001;cov[1][1]+=.001;let det=cov[0][0]*cov[1][1]-cov[0][1]**2,inv=[[cov[1][1]/det,-cov[0][1]/det],[-cov[1][0]/det,cov[0][0]/det]];return{mean,cov,inv}})();\nfunction distance(x){let a=x.map((v,j)=>v-model.mean[j]);return Math.sqrt(Math.max(0,a[0]*(model.inv[0][0]*a[0]+model.inv[0][1]*a[1])+a[1]*(model.inv[1][0]*a[0]+model.inv[1][1]*a[1])))}\nfunction makeWell(seed){let r=rng(seed),cx=10+r()*6,cy=6+r()*7,truth=[],raw=[],noise=[],pollution=[];for(let y=0;y<SPEC.h;y++)for(let x=0;x<SPEC.w;x++){let target=((x-cx)/4)**2+((y-cy)/3)**2<1,other=(x-3-r()*.3)**2+(y-4)**2<4,t=(r()+r()-1)*.5;truth.push(+target);pollution.push(+other);raw.push([1.5+t,1.4+t*.8+(r()+r()-1)*.09+(target?.48:0)+(other?.7:0)]);noise.push([r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1])}return{seed,truth,raw,noise,pollution}}\nfunction compute(w,nl,threshold){let raw=w.raw.map((a,i)=>a.map((v,j)=>v+w.noise[i][j]*nl*.23)),scores=raw.map(distance),pred=scores.map(v=>+(v>threshold)),base=raw.map(a=>+(a[1]>1.9));return{raw,scores,pred,base,stats:f1(pred,w.truth),baseline:f1(base,w.truth)}}\nfunction render(){let d=result;plot('raw-image',i=>{let t=clamp(d.scores[i]/10,0,1);return rgb([.9-.65*t,.94-.4*t,.89-.65*t])});plot('mask-image',outputColor);let s=chartGrid(.5,2.8,'双指标空间：每点为一个采样位置（示意无量纲）');s='';for(let x of [.5,1,1.5,2,2.5]){let vx=48+(x-.5)/2.3*636;s+='<line x1=\"'+vx+'\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"'+vx+'\" y2=\"157\" stroke=\"#eee9df\"/>'+svgText(vx,174,x.toFixed(1))}for(let v of [.5,1,1.5,2,2.5]){let y=157-(v-.5)/2.3*139;s+='<line x1=\"48\" y1=\"'+y+'\" x2=\"684\" y2=\"'+y+'\" stroke=\"#eee9df\"/>'+svgText(3,y+3,v.toFixed(1))}let t=+$('param').value,c=model.cov,l00=Math.sqrt(c[0][0]),l10=c[1][0]/l00,l11=Math.sqrt(c[1][1]-l10*l10),pts=[];for(let k=0;k<=80;k++){let a=k/80*Math.PI*2,x=model.mean[0]+t*l00*Math.cos(a),y=model.mean[1]+t*(l10*Math.cos(a)+l11*Math.sin(a));pts.push((k?'L':'M')+(48+(x-.5)/2.3*636).toFixed(1)+' '+(157-(y-.5)/2.3*139).toFixed(1))}s+='<defs><clipPath id=\"scatter-clip\"><rect x=\"48\" y=\"18\" width=\"636\" height=\"139\"/></clipPath></defs><g clip-path=\"url(#scatter-clip)\"><path d=\"'+pts.join('')+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>';d.raw.forEach((a,i)=>{s+='<circle cx=\"'+(48+(a[0]-.5)/2.3*636)+'\" cy=\"'+(157-(a[1]-.5)/2.3*139)+'\" r=\"'+(i===selected.y*SPEC.w+selected.x?4:1.7)+'\" fill=\"'+(i===selected.y*SPEC.w+selected.x?'#111':d.pred[i]?'#b26a39':'#2f7d6b')+'\" opacity=\".75\"/>'});s+='</g>'+svgText(48,13,'指标 A / B 联合分布：椭圆为当前马氏距离阈值')+svgText(450,190,'横轴 A；纵轴 B；黑点为所选样本');$('diagnostic').innerHTML=s;metrics([['组合异常 F1',d.stats.f.toFixed(3)],['单 B 阈值 F1',d.baseline.f.toFixed(3)],['误报 / 漏报',d.stats.fp+' / '+d.stats.fn],['待复核点数',String(d.pred.filter(Boolean).length)]]);$('note').innerHTML='左图每格对应一个实际采样点，颜色越深，偏离背景越大，<b>未作空间插值</b>。左上另有合成污染点，会被模型识别为异常，却不属于目标真值；异常不是油气存在的证明。';$('coefficients').innerHTML=table(['固定背景统计量','数值'],[['样本数',training.length],['均值 A / B',model.mean.map(v=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' / ')],['协方差第一行',model.cov[0].map(v=>v.toFixed(5)).join(' / ')],['协方差第二行',model.cov[1].map(v=>v.toFixed(5)).join(' / ')]])+'<p>基线 B &gt; 1.9；组合判别 D &gt; 当前阈值。统计量从独立背景样本学习，不在测试区重新拟合。</p>'}\nfunction inspect(){let i=position(),d=result;pointValues([['指标 A / B',d.raw[i].map(v=>v.toFixed(3)).join(' / ')],['马氏距离 / 阈值',d.scores[i].toFixed(2)+' / '+(+$('param').value).toFixed(2)],['真值 / 异常判别',well.truth[i]+' / '+d.pred[i]],['教学污染标签',well.pollution[i]?'污染模拟点':'非污染模拟点']],'地图坐标为 0.5 km/格的教学采样网格；颜色不代表油气概率。目标标签和污染标签只用于教学验收，没有进入评分。下图说明为什么在正常相关关系外的点，即使绝对值并不最高，仍可能需要复核。现场需查污染、地形、季节并用独立空间区块验证。')}\nfunction csvRows(){return{head:['sample_seed','x_km','y_km','indicator_A','indicator_B','mahalanobis_distance','truth_target','synthetic_pollution','predicted_alarm','single_B_alarm'],rows:result.raw.map((a,i)=>[well.seed,(i%SPEC.w)*SPEC.scale,Math.floor(i/SPEC.w)*SPEC.scale,...a,result.scores[i],well.truth[i],well.pollution[i],result.pred[i],result.base[i]])}}\ninitialize();\n\n})();"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){const host=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>host.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"geology-map-vector-v22","sceneId":"g3","title":"地质图件要素智能提取：图例中心学习 + 拒识 + 连通追踪","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-01","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"历史地质图里的颜色、断层线与注记都是像素。本例学习图例颜色，用纸白参考校正扫描亮度，拒绝无法识别的颜色，再从断层掩膜追踪候选折线；比较栅格分类和矢量顶点是否对应。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"图例中心学习 + 拒识 + 连通追踪","desc":"实际前端计算，可查看模型与结果"},{"label":"资料","value":"4 类 ×120 图例样本","desc":"合成教学资料，与测试独立"},{"label":"交互","value":"换样例 / 实时联动","desc":"地图、输入、输出与逐点解释同步"},{"label":"验收","value":"真值 / 基线 / 错误","desc":"指标与错误位置一起看"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"PROBLEM","title":"专业对象与业务问题","html":"<p>历史地质图常以扫描图或 PDF 保存，图例、断层线和注记只是栅格像素。把图面要素转成结构化图层，有助于盆地地质资料复用、线索对比和后续物探解释。像素分类与可用 GIS 成果之间还有坐标和拓扑两道关。</p><figure style=\"margin:15px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"地质图件要素智能提取专业概念图\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#faf8f2\"/><g fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"13\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"30\" width=\"70\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#bc9457\"/><rect x=\"95\" y=\"30\" width=\"70\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#6d8a72\"/><path d=\"M65 30L145 130\" stroke=\"#ba5448\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M185 30L265 130\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"55\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"245\" cy=\"105\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"55\">左：扫描像素有颜色，没有坐标语义</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"91\">中：候选折线有顶点，仍需拓扑修正</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"127\">图像像素坐标 ≠ 地理投影坐标</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">概念示意；数值与图形不代表实际工区成果。</figcaption></figure><p>不同年代图例、纸张褪色和扫描光照会改变颜色，黑色注记还会遮挡线条。若强制把所有像素归入已知岩性，会制造假要素；若直接逐行平均多条线，又容易把它们错误合并。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"METHOD","title":"智能化方法如何介入","html":"<p>四类独立图例样本学习 RGB 中心。以图面上边缘已知纸白区估计亮度，再计算校正像素与各中心的欧氏距离；最近距离超过阈值就拒识。对预测断层掩膜做八邻域连通组件提取，在每个组件内逐行取中心，生成候选折线。</p><figure style=\"margin:16px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 135\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图例给颜色语义，纸白帮助亮度校正，未知颜色先拒识，掩膜追踪为候选线\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">01</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">图例给颜色语义</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee9db\"/><text x=\"201\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">02</text><text x=\"201\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">纸白帮助亮度校正</text><rect x=\"366\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e4ebf1\"/><text x=\"377\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">03</text><text x=\"377\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">未知颜色先拒识</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f3e5da\"/><text x=\"553\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">04</text><text x=\"553\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">掩膜追踪为候选线</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">概念关系示意：输入证据、方法与地质解释分开核对。</figcaption></figure><p>图内像素准确率、未校正基线、断层 F1、折线与顶点数。纸边不计准确率，内部注记纳入未知类。候选矢量图与栅格图联动，CSV 同时导出像素和 vertex 记录，顶点带组件编号与支持像素数。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"资料、标注与独立验证","html":"<p>80×60 合成图件含三类单元、两条断层色线、纸边和黑色注记代理。图例样本为每类 120 个，测试图不参与学习。换图改变线的位置、斜率、扫描亮度和噪声；拒识阈值控制漏识/误识。纸白是可见校正参考，不是测试真值。</p><p>训练与测试分开生成；真值只用于验收和对照显示，不进入当前测试样例的模型评分、追踪或投票。演示在浏览器中直接运行实际数值计算，未使用后端。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"REVIEW","title":"解释边界与参考方向","html":"<p>演示图例学习与简化栅格矢量转换，没有 OCR、符号检测、地理配准或完整拓扑重建。交叉或分叉仍可能合并，碎线可能漏追；输出的是图像像素坐标，不直接当作 GIS 断层成果。</p><p><a href=\"https://ngmdb.usgs.gov/fgdc_gds/geolsymstd.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USGS：FGDC 地质图符号标准</a>；<a href=\"https://ngmdb.usgs.gov/fgdc_gds/geolsymstd/downloadbytheme.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USGS：图例与符号分类下载</a>。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"地质图件要素智能提取：从资料到可复核的候选结果","lead":["历史地质图里的颜色、断层线与注记都是像素。本例学习图例颜色，用纸白参考校正扫描亮度，拒绝无法识别的颜色，再从断层掩膜追踪候选折线；比较栅格分类和矢量顶点是否对应。"],"stats":[["训练与测试","独立样例"],["计算","纯前端"],["验证","基线 + 错误定位"]],"steps":[{"name":"整理图例与参考区","role":"资料准备","do":"确定本图例对应的地质语义，准备独立图例样本和纸白亮度参考；检查扫描质量。 **图例样本 / 纸白 → 可解释输入**","effect":"图例样本 / 纸白 → 可解释输入","trap":"不同图幅颜色相似，语义可能并不相同。"},{"name":"学习颜色并校正亮度","role":"模型学习","do":"计算四类 RGB 中心，从纸白估计测试图亮度；不读取内部测试标签。 **原 RGB → 亮度校正 → 中心距离**","effect":"原 RGB → 亮度校正 → 中心距离","trap":"此处只用整体亮度校正，不能解决非均匀污渍或色偏。"},{"name":"拒识与连通组件追踪","role":"独立推理","do":"距离过大的像素保留未知；在预测断层类中提取组件，按组件逐行生成中心顶点。 **候选掩膜 → 连通组件 → 折线**","effect":"候选掩膜 → 连通组件 → 折线","trap":"同一组件内的多分支仍可能被平均，人工必须修正。"},{"name":"核对栅格和候选矢量","role":"可视复核","do":"比较拒识、误差与折线碎裂，切换真值，导出像素与顶点记录。 **图件 ↔ 掩膜 ↔ 顶点表**","effect":"图件 ↔ 掩膜 ↔ 顶点表","trap":"没有配准和拓扑检查的折线不是最终 GIS 图层。"}],"metrics":{"title":"用什么判断做得好","html":"<figure style=\"margin:16px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 135\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"整理图例与参考区，学习颜色并校正亮度，拒识与连通组件追踪，核对栅格和候选矢量\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">01</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">整理图例与参考区</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee9db\"/><text x=\"201\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">02</text><text x=\"201\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">学习颜色并校正亮度</text><rect x=\"366\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e4ebf1\"/><text x=\"377\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">03</text><text x=\"377\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">拒识与连通组件追踪</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f3e5da\"/><text x=\"553\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">04</text><text x=\"553\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">核对栅格和候选矢量</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">工序链：每步都有输入、可见结果和需要复核的误差。</figcaption></figure><p>图内像素准确率、未校正基线、断层 F1、折线与顶点数。纸边不计准确率，内部注记纳入未知类。候选矢量图与栅格图联动，CSV 同时导出像素和 vertex 记录，顶点带组件编号与支持像素数。</p><p>演示图例学习与简化栅格矢量转换，没有 OCR、符号检测、地理配准或完整拓扑重建。交叉或分叉仍可能合并，碎线可能漏追；输出的是图像像素坐标，不直接当作 GIS 断层成果。</p>"},"fails":[{"name":"注记遮挡","why":"未知区不等于空白，可能需要人工补线。"},{"name":"阈值两难","why":"阈值小会漏识褪色线，阈值大会接纳不相关颜色。"},{"name":"连通不等于同一断层","why":"交点和分支的地质解释需要额外证据。"}]},"demo":{"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"历史地质图里的颜色、断层线与注记都是像素。本例学习图例颜色，用纸白参考校正扫描亮度，拒绝无法识别的颜色，再从断层掩膜追踪候选折线；比较栅格分类和矢量顶点是否对应。","height":780}}},demo={"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"历史地质图里的颜色、断层线与注记都是像素。本例学习图例颜色，用纸白参考校正扫描亮度，拒绝无法识别的颜色，再从断层掩膜追踪候选折线；比较栅格分类和矢量顶点是否对应。","height":780},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":3957,"mime":"text/html","enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>地质图件要素智能提取 · v2.2</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\" id=\"sample-name\">独立合成测试样例</span><h1>扫描图上的颜色，怎样变成可检查的线和单元？</h1><p class=\"lead\">历史地质图里的颜色、断层线与注记都是像素。本例学习图例颜色，用纸白参考校正扫描亮度，拒绝无法识别的颜色，再从断层掩膜追踪候选折线；比较栅格分类和矢量顶点是否对应。</p></div><button id=\"new-sample\" class=\"btn primary\" type=\"button\">换一幅图件 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"noise\">观测噪声 <output id=\"out-noise\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1.5\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.25\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"param\">图例距离拒识阈值 <output id=\"out-param\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.05\" max=\"0.45\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.22\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts\" aria-label=\"输入、模型与可视分析\"><div class=\"map-tools\"><label for=\"view-mode\">右图显示</label><select id=\"view-mode\"><option value=\"pred\">模型预测</option><option value=\"truth\">合成真值（验收）</option><option value=\"error\">错误位置</option></select><span>点击任一地图，联动逐点解释</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span style=\"color:#bc9457\">■ 砂质</span><span style=\"color:#6d8a72\">■ 泥质</span><span style=\"color:#7395b6\">■ 碳酸盐</span><span style=\"color:#ba5448\">■ 断层线候选</span><span>灰：未识别</span></div><div class=\"image-pair\"><figure><figcaption>含褪色与黑色注记的合成扫描图</figcaption><canvas id=\"raw-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"330\" aria-label=\"含褪色与黑色注记的合成扫描图\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>图例类别 / 未识别区（可切换真值/错误）</figcaption><canvas id=\"mask-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"330\" aria-label=\"图例类别 / 未识别区\"></canvas></figure></div><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 205\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"候选折线图\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div class=\"readouts\"><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml0\"></span><b id=\"m0\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml1\"></span><b id=\"m1\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml2\"></span><b id=\"m2\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml3\"></span><b id=\"m3\">—</b></div></div><p id=\"note\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：输入、判断与依据</h2><span id=\"point-location\"></span></div><div class=\"coordinates\"><label for=\"point-x\">横坐标<input id=\"point-x\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"79\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label><label for=\"point-y\">纵坐标<input id=\"point-y\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"59\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label></div><div class=\"point-values\" id=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型、训练与本次结果明细</summary><p>图例中心学习 + 拒识 + 连通追踪；4 类 ×120 图例样本，独立于当前测试图件。</p><div id=\"coefficients\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"export\" type=\"button\">导出本次 CSV</button><span>同样例滑动不重抽数据；更换样例不改变训练模型。</span></div><p class=\"note\">演示图例学习与简化栅格矢量转换，没有 OCR、符号检测、地理配准或完整拓扑重建。交叉或分叉仍可能合并，碎线可能漏追；输出的是图像像素坐标，不直接当作 GIS 断层成果。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":8463,"mime":"text/css","enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.image-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.image-pair figure{margin:0;min-width:0}.image-pair figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px;min-height:32px}.image-pair canvas{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:#fff}.map-tools{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:11px}.map-tools select{font:inherit;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px;color:var(--jade);border-radius:5px}#diagnostic{margin-top:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:#fff}.demo-results table{font-size:10px;table-layout:auto}.demo-results th,.demo-results td{padding:5px 4px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}.demo-charts .legend{font-size:10px}canvas{cursor:crosshair;touch-action:manipulation}.coordinates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:10px 0}.coordinates label{white-space:nowrap;font-size:11px;display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:center}.coordinates input{min-width:0;width:100%;accent-color:var(--jade)}.demo-results .note{line-height:1.85}@media(max-width:560px){.image-pair{gap:6px}.image-pair figcaption{font-size:10px}.demo-head>div{min-width:180px}}"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":10685,"mime":"text/javascript","enc":"text","data":"(function(){\nconst SPEC={\"key\":\"map\",\"w\":80,\"h\":60,\"scale\":1,\"axis\":\"图件像素 x → / y ↓，原点左上\",\"noise\":0.25,\"value\":0.22,\"sample\":\"图件\",\"digits\":2,\"binary\":false};\n'use strict';\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x)),avg=a=>a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/a.length;\nfunction rng(seed){return()=>{seed=(Math.imul(seed,1664525)+1013904223)>>>0;return seed/4294967296}}\nconst unitNames=['砂质单元','泥质单元','碳酸盐单元','断层线候选'],unitColors=['#bc9457','#6d8a72','#7395b6','#ba5448'];\nfunction f1(a,b){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;for(let i=0;i<a.length;i++){if(a[i]&&b[i])tp++;else if(a[i])fp++;else if(b[i])fn++}return{tp,fp,fn,f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),precision:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fp),recall:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fn)}}\nfunction table(headers,rows){return '<table><tr>'+headers.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.map(r=>'<tr>'+r.map(v=>'<td>'+v+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>'}\nfunction metrics(a){a.forEach(([k,v],i)=>{$('ml'+i).textContent=k;$('m'+i).textContent=v})}\nfunction pointValues(a,text){$('point-values').innerHTML=a.map(([k,v])=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+v+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=text}\nconst CW=400,CH=330,OX=40,OY=15,PW=348,PH=276;\nfunction plot(id,color){let g=$(id).getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,CW,CH);for(let y=0;y<SPEC.h;y++)for(let x=0;x<SPEC.w;x++){g.fillStyle=color(y*SPEC.w+x);g.fillRect(OX+x*PW/SPEC.w,OY+y*PH/SPEC.h,PW/SPEC.w+.4,PH/SPEC.h+.4)}g.fillStyle='#79828a';g.font='10px sans-serif';for(let t of [0,.5,1]){g.fillText((t*(SPEC.w-1)*SPEC.scale).toFixed(1),OX+t*PW-8,CH-23);g.fillText((t*(SPEC.h-1)*SPEC.scale).toFixed(1),2,OY+t*PH+3)}g.fillText(SPEC.axis,OX,CH-6);g.strokeStyle='#b26a39';g.lineWidth=1;let x=OX+(selected.x+.5)*PW/SPEC.w,y=OY+(selected.y+.5)*PH/SPEC.h;g.beginPath();g.moveTo(x-7,y);g.lineTo(x+7,y);g.moveTo(x,y-7);g.lineTo(x,y+7);g.stroke();return g}\nconst rgb=a=>'rgb('+a.map(v=>Math.round(clamp(v,0,1)*255)).join(',')+')';\nfunction outputColor(i){let mode=$('view-mode').value,p=result.pred[i],t=well.truth[i];if(mode==='truth')return t<0?'#f3f1e9':SPEC.binary?(t?'#2f7d6b':'#f3f1e9'):unitColors[t];if(mode==='error')return p===t?'#e5efe8':p<0?'#c9c6c1':SPEC.binary?(p?'#b26a39':'#41699b'):'#ba5448';return p<0?'#e8e5db':SPEC.binary?(p?'#2f7d6b':'#f3f1e9'):unitColors[p]}\nfunction svgText(x,y,s,color='#79828a',size=11){return '<text x=\"'+x+'\" y=\"'+y+'\" fill=\"'+color+'\" font-size=\"'+size+'\">'+s+'</text>'}\nfunction linePath(a,lo,hi,top=22,height=125){return a.map((v,i)=>(i?'L':'M')+(48+i/Math.max(1,a.length-1)*636).toFixed(1)+' '+(top+(hi-v)/(hi-lo)*height).toFixed(1)).join('')}\nfunction curve(a,lo,hi,color,top=22,height=125){return '<path d=\"'+linePath(a,lo,hi,top,height)+'\" stroke=\"'+color+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>'}\nfunction chartGrid(lo,hi,label){let s=svgText(48,13,label,'#4d565b');for(let k=0;k<3;k++){let y=22+k*62.5;s+='<line x1=\"48\" y1=\"'+y+'\" x2=\"684\" y2=\"'+y+'\" stroke=\"#e9e5dc\"/>'+svgText(3,y+4,(hi-(hi-lo)*k/2).toFixed(1))}return s}\nlet sampleIndex=0,well=null,result=null,pending=0,selected={x:Math.floor(SPEC.w*.55),y:Math.floor(SPEC.h*.55)};\nfunction refresh(){let n=+$('noise').value,p=+$('param').value;$('out-noise').textContent=n.toFixed(2);$('out-param').textContent=SPEC.percent?(p*100).toFixed(0)+'%':p.toFixed(SPEC.digits??2);$('sample-name').textContent='独立合成'+SPEC.sample+' '+String(sampleIndex+1).padStart(3,'0')+' · 种子 '+well.seed;result=compute(well,n,p);render();inspect()}\nfunction flush(){if(pending){cancelAnimationFrame(pending);pending=0}refresh()}\nfunction schedule(){if(!pending)pending=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{pending=0;refresh()})}\nfunction initialize(){well=makeWell(12031);for(let id of ['noise','param']){$(id).addEventListener('input',schedule);$(id).addEventListener('change',flush)}$('new-sample').addEventListener('click',()=>{well=makeWell(12031+7919*++sampleIndex);flush()});$('reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{sampleIndex=0;well=makeWell(12031);$('noise').value=SPEC.noise;$('param').value=SPEC.value;selected={x:Math.floor(SPEC.w*.55),y:Math.floor(SPEC.h*.55)};flush()});for(let id of ['raw-image','mask-image'])$(id).addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$(id).getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*CW,y=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*CH;selected={x:Math.floor(clamp((x-OX)/PW*SPEC.w,0,SPEC.w-1)),y:Math.floor(clamp((y-OY)/PH*SPEC.h,0,SPEC.h-1))};render();inspect()});$('view-mode').addEventListener('change',()=>{render();inspect()});$('point-x').max=SPEC.w-1;$('point-y').max=SPEC.h-1;for(let id of ['point-x','point-y'])$(id).addEventListener('input',()=>{selected={x:+$('point-x').value,y:+$('point-y').value};render();inspect()});$('export').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(pending)flush();let c=csvRows(),quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[c.head,...c.rows].map(r=>r.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download=SPEC.key+'-'+well.seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)});refresh()}\nfunction position(){let i=selected.y*SPEC.w+selected.x;$('point-x').value=selected.x;$('point-y').value=selected.y;$('point-location').textContent='('+selected.x+', '+selected.y+')';return i}\n\nconst palette=[[.80,.70,.43],[.40,.64,.45],[.68,.75,.83],[.77,.17,.14]];\nconst training=(()=>{let r=rng(3941),a=[];for(let k=0;k<4;k++)for(let j=0;j<120;j++)a.push({x:palette[k].map(v=>v+(r()+r()-1)*.045),label:k});return a})();\nconst model=palette.map((_,k)=>[0,1,2].map(j=>avg(training.filter(v=>v.label===k).map(v=>v.x[j]))));\nfunction makeWell(seed){let r=rng(seed),illum=.45+r()*.30,offset=r()*10,slope=.20+r()*.25,truth=[],raw=[],noise=[];for(let y=0;y<SPEC.h;y++)for(let x=0;x<SPEC.w;x++){let margin=y<3||x<3||x>SPEC.w-4||y>SPEC.h-4,k=margin?-1:Math.abs(x-(15+offset+y*slope))<.8||Math.abs(x-(63-offset-y*.13))<.8?3:x<28+Math.sin(y/9)*4?0:x<53+Math.sin(y/12)*3?1:2;let annotation=y>29&&y<35&&x>33&&x<44&&(x%4<2||y%3===0);if(annotation)k=-1;let color=margin?[.96,.96,.96]:annotation?[.15,.15,.15]:palette[k];truth.push(k);raw.push(color.map(v=>v*illum));noise.push([r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1])}return{seed,truth,raw,noise}}\nfunction nearest(x,threshold){let ds=model.map(m=>Math.sqrt(m.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+(v-x[j])**2,0))),distance=Math.min(...ds);return{label:distance<=threshold?ds.indexOf(distance):-1,distance}}\nfunction trace(pred){let visited=new Uint8Array(pred.length),components=[],paths=[];for(let i=0;i<pred.length;i++){if(pred[i]!==3||visited[i])continue;let queue=[i];visited[i]=1;for(let k=0;k<queue.length;k++){let p=queue[k],x=p%SPEC.w,y=Math.floor(p/SPEC.w);for(let dy=-1;dy<=1;dy++)for(let dx=-1;dx<=1;dx++){let xx=x+dx,yy=y+dy,j=yy*SPEC.w+xx;if(xx<0||yy<0||xx>=SPEC.w||yy>=SPEC.h||visited[j]||pred[j]!==3)continue;visited[j]=1;queue.push(j)}}if(queue.length<6)continue;components.push(queue);let byRow=new Map();for(let p of queue){let y=Math.floor(p/SPEC.w);if(!byRow.has(y))byRow.set(y,[]);byRow.get(y).push(p%SPEC.w)}let pts=[...byRow].sort((a,b)=>a[0]-b[0]).map(([y,x])=>[avg(x),y,x.length]);if(pts.length>=3)paths.push(pts)}return{components,paths}}\nfunction compute(w,nl,threshold){let raw=w.raw.map((a,i)=>a.map((v,j)=>clamp(v+w.noise[i][j]*nl*.16,0,1))),paper=[];for(let y=0;y<2;y++)for(let x=0;x<SPEC.w;x++)paper.push(avg(raw[y*SPEC.w+x]));let illumination=Math.max(.1,avg(paper)/.96),corrected=raw.map(a=>a.map(v=>clamp(v/illumination,0,1))),all=corrected.map(a=>nearest(a,threshold)),pred=all.map(v=>v.label),base=raw.map(a=>nearest(a,Infinity).label),geometry=trace(pred),valid=w.truth.map((v,i)=>i).filter(i=>i%SPEC.w>=3&&i%SPEC.w<SPEC.w-3&&Math.floor(i/SPEC.w)>=3&&Math.floor(i/SPEC.w)<SPEC.h-3),accuracy=a=>100*valid.filter(i=>a[i]===w.truth[i]).length/valid.length;return{raw,corrected,all,pred,base,geometry,illumination,accuracy:accuracy(pred),baseline:accuracy(base),stats:f1(pred.map(v=>+(v===3)),w.truth.map(v=>+(v===3))),rejected:valid.filter(i=>pred[i]<0).length}}\nfunction render(){let d=result;plot('raw-image',i=>rgb(d.raw[i]));plot('mask-image',outputColor);let s=svgText(48,14,'候选矢量追踪：按连通组件逐行取中心（图像坐标）'),sx=x=>48+x/(SPEC.w-1)*636,sy=y=>26+y/(SPEC.h-1)*124;s+='<rect x=\"48\" y=\"26\" width=\"636\" height=\"124\" fill=\"#f8f6ef\" stroke=\"#e4dfd4\"/>';d.geometry.paths.forEach((pts,k)=>{s+='<path d=\"'+pts.map(([x,y],i)=>(i?'L':'M')+sx(x).toFixed(2)+' '+sy(y).toFixed(2)).join('')+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"'+['#b26a39','#2f7d6b','#41699b'][k%3]+'\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>'});s+=svgText(48,174,'图像原点左上；连通的分叉/交点仍可能被合并，不能直接作为 GIS 断层成果');$('diagnostic').innerHTML=s;metrics([['图内像素准确率',d.accuracy.toFixed(1)+'%'],['未校正基线',d.baseline.toFixed(1)+'%'],['断层像素 F1',d.stats.f.toFixed(3)],['折线 / 顶点',d.geometry.paths.length+' / '+d.geometry.paths.reduce((s,v)=>s+v.length,0)]]);$('note').innerHTML='从上边缘纸白参考估计扫描亮度，再和固定图例中心比较。距离过大标为<b>未识别</b>，防止把黑色注记强塞进岩性。下图只追踪预测断层像素，调噪声可见折线断裂；未做 OCR。';$('coefficients').innerHTML=table(['四类图例中心','R','G','B'],model.map((m,k)=>[unitNames[k],...m.map(v=>v.toFixed(3))]))+'<p>亮度估计 '+d.illumination.toFixed(3)+'；图内拒识 '+d.rejected+' 像素。4 类×120 个独立图例样本；空白纸边不计入准确率。基线为未经亮度校正的最近中心，不拒识。</p>';}\nfunction inspect(){let i=position(),d=result,n=k=>k<0?'未知 / 注记或纸白':unitNames[k];pointValues([['原始 RGB',d.raw[i].map(v=>v.toFixed(2)).join(' / ')],['校正 RGB',d.corrected[i].map(v=>v.toFixed(2)).join(' / ')],['最近中心距离',d.all[i].distance.toFixed(3)],['真值 / 输出',n(well.truth[i])+' / '+n(d.pred[i])]],'已知纸白参考和待识别图例是不同的数据来源，估计亮度不读取测试标签。拒识阈值越小越谨慎，也会漏掉褪色线条。下方矢量追踪只在预测掩膜上运行；行中心法可能把同一连通组件中的分叉误合并，需要人工修正，不含 OCR、投影坐标或 GIS 拓扑。')}\nfunction csvRows(){let rows=[];result.raw.forEach((a,i)=>rows.push(['pixel',well.seed,i%SPEC.w,Math.floor(i/SPEC.w),...a,well.truth[i],result.pred[i],'','']));result.geometry.paths.forEach((pts,k)=>pts.forEach(([x,y,n])=>rows.push(['vertex',well.seed,x,y,'','','','',3,k+1,n])));return{head:['record_type','sample_seed','x_px','y_px','R','G','B','truth_class','predicted_class','polyline_id','support_pixels'],rows}}\ninitialize();\n\n})();"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){const host=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>host.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"geology-outcrop-hough-v22","sceneId":"g4","title":"露头裂缝自动统计：局部对比逻辑回归 + Hough 统计","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-01","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"露头裂缝为裂缝型储层认识提供类比信息，但照片上的暗线不自动等于真实节理。本例学习暗度与局部对比，分割候选像素，再用 Hough 投票提取二维迹线，联动查看玫瑰图、线长和误检。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"局部对比逻辑回归 + Hough 统计","desc":"实际前端计算，可查看模型与结果"},{"label":"资料","value":"4 图 / 1600 标注像素","desc":"合成教学资料，与测试独立"},{"label":"交互","value":"换样例 / 实时联动","desc":"地图、输入、输出与逐点解释同步"},{"label":"验收","value":"真值 / 基线 / 错误","desc":"指标与错误位置一起看"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"PROBLEM","title":"专业对象与业务问题","html":"<p>露头是理解地下裂缝系统的类比窗口。地质人员通常用罗盘、皮尺记录裂缝方向、间距与长度，而陡壁或高处往往难以覆盖。图像统计能辅助重复测量和复查，但必须区分二维照片迹线和三维地质产状。</p><figure style=\"margin:15px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"露头裂缝自动统计专业概念图\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#faf8f2\"/><g fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"13\"><path d=\"M30 125L105 30M65 135L140 40M100 145L175 50M25 45L200 125\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M35 143H135\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"55\">暗迹线 → 候选像素 → 二维线段</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"91\">标尺：像素换长度；姿态：方向换产状</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"127\">只知道标尺，仍不能反算三维走向倾角</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">概念示意；数值与图形不代表实际工区成果。</figcaption></figure><p>裂缝细、对比度弱，纹理和阴影也可能形成暗线。分割后若不检查重复候选，会把一条粗裂缝算成多条。缺少标尺、镜头和相机姿态校正时，像素长度和角度也不能直接解释为现场产状。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"METHOD","title":"智能化方法如何介入","html":"<p>从独立图学习逻辑回归，输入暗度与邻域对比，输出候选像素分数。对阈值后的像素计算 ρ = x cosθ + y sinθ 的 Hough 投票，法向角步长 2°、至少 24 票；抑制邻近峰并裁剪到图面。迹线图像角为法向角+90°，对 180° 取模。</p><figure style=\"margin:16px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 135\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"暗度与局部对比，学习像素候选，Hough 投票与去重，二维方向 / 线长统计\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">01</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">暗度与局部对比</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee9db\"/><text x=\"201\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">02</text><text x=\"201\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">学习像素候选</text><rect x=\"366\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e4ebf1\"/><text x=\"377\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">03</text><text x=\"377\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">Hough 投票与去重</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f3e5da\"/><text x=\"553\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">04</text><text x=\"553\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">二维方向 / 线长统计</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">概念关系示意：输入证据、方法与地质解释分开核对。</figcaption></figure><p>分割 F1 与固定灰度基线、候选线数、裁剪线长总和/露面面积；按线长加权的 180° 对称玫瑰图展示图像方向。候选线端点、法向角、票数和线长可导出。最多保留 10 条，达到上限会标注。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"资料、标注与独立验证","html":"<p>四幅合成训练图，每图抽 200 暗迹线+200 背景像素。测试露面为 80×64 像素，真值包含交叉的两个方向组。标尺固定为 20 px/m 的教学假设。换露头改变方向、位置和纹理，模型固定；现场需标定板、相机/露面姿态以及独立露头实测验证。</p><p>训练与测试分开生成；真值只用于验收和对照显示，不进入当前测试样例的模型评分、追踪或投票。演示在浏览器中直接运行实际数值计算，未使用后端。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"REVIEW","title":"解释边界与参考方向","html":"<p>演示二维像素分割与直线迹线统计，不做实例分割、三维摄影测量、开度测量或地质走向倾角反算。候选线数不等于节理数量，二维迹线强度不能直接换成地下渗透率。</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.opencv.org/4.x/d9/db0/tutorial_hough_lines.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenCV：Hough 直线变换</a>；<a href=\"https://ngmdb.usgs.gov/fgdc_gds/geolsymstd.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USGS：地质要素符号与产状表达</a>。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"露头裂缝自动统计：从资料到可复核的候选结果","lead":["露头裂缝为裂缝型储层认识提供类比信息，但照片上的暗线不自动等于真实节理。本例学习暗度与局部对比，分割候选像素，再用 Hough 投票提取二维迹线，联动查看玫瑰图、线长和误检。"],"stats":[["训练与测试","独立样例"],["计算","纯前端"],["验证","基线 + 错误定位"]],"steps":[{"name":"建立有标尺的图像资料","role":"资料准备","do":"规范照片、露面范围与标注口径，按露头或图幅隔离训练测试。本例提供合成 20 px/m 标尺。 **露面 / 标尺 / 掩膜 → 独立资料**","effect":"露面 / 标尺 / 掩膜 → 独立资料","trap":"不做几何标定就不能把图像角称为走向倾角。"},{"name":"学习局部像素证据","role":"模型学习","do":"用四幅图的标注像素学习暗度和邻域对比系数，训练完成后固定参数。 **灰度 / 邻域 → 逻辑回归分数**","effect":"灰度 / 邻域 → 逻辑回归分数","trap":"均衡训练分数不是现场裂缝出现概率。"},{"name":"投票、抑制和裁剪","role":"独立推理","do":"只用预测像素做 Hough 投票，抑制相邻重复峰；将无限候选线裁剪为图内线段。 **掩膜 → 投票峰 → 候选线段**","effect":"掩膜 → 投票峰 → 候选线段","trap":"粗线、交叉和高噪声会产生重复或虚假线。"},{"name":"按二维口径统计并复核","role":"可视复核","do":"查看玫瑰图、线长和掩膜 F1，检查候选表及端点，导出像素与候选线。 **候选方向 / 线长 → 逐点复核**","effect":"候选方向 / 线长 → 逐点复核","trap":"二维迹线强度不是三维裂缝密度或导流能力。"}],"metrics":{"title":"用什么判断做得好","html":"<figure style=\"margin:16px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 135\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"建立有标尺的图像资料，学习局部像素证据，投票、抑制和裁剪，按二维口径统计并复核\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"25\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">01</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">建立有标尺的图像资料</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee9db\"/><text x=\"201\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">02</text><text x=\"201\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">学习局部像素证据</text><rect x=\"366\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e4ebf1\"/><text x=\"377\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">03</text><text x=\"377\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">投票、抑制和裁剪</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"26\" width=\"158\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#f3e5da\"/><text x=\"553\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6c7b77\">04</text><text x=\"553\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\">按二维口径统计并复核</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a\">工序链：每步都有输入、可见结果和需要复核的误差。</figcaption></figure><p>分割 F1 与固定灰度基线、候选线数、裁剪线长总和/露面面积；按线长加权的 180° 对称玫瑰图展示图像方向。候选线端点、法向角、票数和线长可导出。最多保留 10 条，达到上限会标注。</p><p>演示二维像素分割与直线迹线统计，不做实例分割、三维摄影测量、开度测量或地质走向倾角反算。候选线数不等于节理数量，二维迹线强度不能直接换成地下渗透率。</p>"},"fails":[{"name":"阴影与纹理误检","why":"暗线证据不足以证明地质裂缝。"},{"name":"重复峰与短裂缝","why":"投票阈值和峰抑制可能增减候选线。"},{"name":"尺度或姿态错误","why":"长度依赖标尺，角度依赖图像坐标与几何标定。"}]},"demo":{"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"露头裂缝为裂缝型储层认识提供类比信息，但照片上的暗线不自动等于真实节理。本例学习暗度与局部对比，分割候选像素，再用 Hough 投票提取二维迹线，联动查看玫瑰图、线长和误检。","height":780}}},demo={"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"露头裂缝为裂缝型储层认识提供类比信息，但照片上的暗线不自动等于真实节理。本例学习暗度与局部对比，分割候选像素，再用 Hough 投票提取二维迹线，联动查看玫瑰图、线长和误检。","height":780},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":3895,"mime":"text/html","enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>露头裂缝自动统计 · v2.2</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\" id=\"sample-name\">独立合成测试样例</span><h1>从一片暗纹理，到可复核的裂缝迹线方向</h1><p class=\"lead\">露头裂缝为裂缝型储层认识提供类比信息，但照片上的暗线不自动等于真实节理。本例学习暗度与局部对比，分割候选像素，再用 Hough 投票提取二维迹线，联动查看玫瑰图、线长和误检。</p></div><button id=\"new-sample\" class=\"btn primary\" type=\"button\">换一处露头 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"noise\">观测噪声 <output id=\"out-noise\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1.5\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.45\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"param\">像素候选分数阈值 <output id=\"out-param\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.2\" max=\"0.9\" step=\"0.02\" value=\"0.5\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts\" aria-label=\"输入、模型与可视分析\"><div class=\"map-tools\"><label for=\"view-mode\">右图显示</label><select id=\"view-mode\"><option value=\"pred\">模型预测</option><option value=\"truth\">合成真值（验收）</option><option value=\"error\">错误位置</option></select><span>点击任一地图，联动逐点解释</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span style=\"color:#2f7d6b\">■ 预测暗迹线</span><span style=\"color:#b26a39\">━ Hough 候选线 / 误报</span><span style=\"color:#41699b\">■ 漏报</span></div><div class=\"image-pair\"><figure><figcaption>带纹理与交叉迹线的合成露面</figcaption><canvas id=\"raw-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"330\" aria-label=\"带纹理与交叉迹线的合成露面\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>候选掩膜 + 裁剪迹线（橙）（可切换真值/错误）</figcaption><canvas id=\"mask-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"330\" aria-label=\"候选掩膜 + 裁剪迹线（橙）\"></canvas></figure></div><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 205\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"二维迹线方向玫瑰图\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div class=\"readouts\"><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml0\"></span><b id=\"m0\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml1\"></span><b id=\"m1\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml2\"></span><b id=\"m2\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml3\"></span><b id=\"m3\">—</b></div></div><p id=\"note\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：输入、判断与依据</h2><span id=\"point-location\"></span></div><div class=\"coordinates\"><label for=\"point-x\">横坐标<input id=\"point-x\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"79\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label><label for=\"point-y\">纵坐标<input id=\"point-y\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"59\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label></div><div class=\"point-values\" id=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型、训练与本次结果明细</summary><p>局部对比逻辑回归 + Hough 统计；4 图 / 1600 标注像素，独立于当前测试露头。</p><div id=\"coefficients\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"export\" type=\"button\">导出本次 CSV</button><span>同样例滑动不重抽数据；更换样例不改变训练模型。</span></div><p class=\"note\">演示二维像素分割与直线迹线统计，不做实例分割、三维摄影测量、开度测量或地质走向倾角反算。候选线数不等于节理数量，二维迹线强度不能直接换成地下渗透率。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":8463,"mime":"text/css","enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.image-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.image-pair figure{margin:0;min-width:0}.image-pair figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px;min-height:32px}.image-pair canvas{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:#fff}.map-tools{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:11px}.map-tools select{font:inherit;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px;color:var(--jade);border-radius:5px}#diagnostic{margin-top:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:#fff}.demo-results table{font-size:10px;table-layout:auto}.demo-results th,.demo-results td{padding:5px 4px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}.demo-charts .legend{font-size:10px}canvas{cursor:crosshair;touch-action:manipulation}.coordinates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:10px 0}.coordinates label{white-space:nowrap;font-size:11px;display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:center}.coordinates input{min-width:0;width:100%;accent-color:var(--jade)}.demo-results .note{line-height:1.85}@media(max-width:560px){.image-pair{gap:6px}.image-pair figcaption{font-size:10px}.demo-head>div{min-width:180px}}"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":12025,"mime":"text/javascript","enc":"text","data":"(function(){\nconst SPEC={\"key\":\"outcrop\",\"w\":80,\"h\":64,\"scale\":0.05,\"axis\":\"教学标尺：20 px/m，图像 x → / y ↓\",\"noise\":0.45,\"value\":0.5,\"sample\":\"露头\",\"digits\":2,\"binary\":true};\n'use strict';\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x)),avg=a=>a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/a.length;\nfunction rng(seed){return()=>{seed=(Math.imul(seed,1664525)+1013904223)>>>0;return seed/4294967296}}\nconst unitNames=['砂质单元','泥质单元','碳酸盐单元','断层线候选'],unitColors=['#bc9457','#6d8a72','#7395b6','#ba5448'];\nfunction f1(a,b){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;for(let i=0;i<a.length;i++){if(a[i]&&b[i])tp++;else if(a[i])fp++;else if(b[i])fn++}return{tp,fp,fn,f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),precision:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fp),recall:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fn)}}\nfunction table(headers,rows){return '<table><tr>'+headers.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.map(r=>'<tr>'+r.map(v=>'<td>'+v+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>'}\nfunction metrics(a){a.forEach(([k,v],i)=>{$('ml'+i).textContent=k;$('m'+i).textContent=v})}\nfunction pointValues(a,text){$('point-values').innerHTML=a.map(([k,v])=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+v+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=text}\nconst CW=400,CH=330,OX=40,OY=15,PW=348,PH=276;\nfunction plot(id,color){let g=$(id).getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,CW,CH);for(let y=0;y<SPEC.h;y++)for(let x=0;x<SPEC.w;x++){g.fillStyle=color(y*SPEC.w+x);g.fillRect(OX+x*PW/SPEC.w,OY+y*PH/SPEC.h,PW/SPEC.w+.4,PH/SPEC.h+.4)}g.fillStyle='#79828a';g.font='10px sans-serif';for(let t of [0,.5,1]){g.fillText((t*(SPEC.w-1)*SPEC.scale).toFixed(1),OX+t*PW-8,CH-23);g.fillText((t*(SPEC.h-1)*SPEC.scale).toFixed(1),2,OY+t*PH+3)}g.fillText(SPEC.axis,OX,CH-6);g.strokeStyle='#b26a39';g.lineWidth=1;let x=OX+(selected.x+.5)*PW/SPEC.w,y=OY+(selected.y+.5)*PH/SPEC.h;g.beginPath();g.moveTo(x-7,y);g.lineTo(x+7,y);g.moveTo(x,y-7);g.lineTo(x,y+7);g.stroke();return g}\nconst rgb=a=>'rgb('+a.map(v=>Math.round(clamp(v,0,1)*255)).join(',')+')';\nfunction outputColor(i){let mode=$('view-mode').value,p=result.pred[i],t=well.truth[i];if(mode==='truth')return t<0?'#f3f1e9':SPEC.binary?(t?'#2f7d6b':'#f3f1e9'):unitColors[t];if(mode==='error')return p===t?'#e5efe8':p<0?'#c9c6c1':SPEC.binary?(p?'#b26a39':'#41699b'):'#ba5448';return p<0?'#e8e5db':SPEC.binary?(p?'#2f7d6b':'#f3f1e9'):unitColors[p]}\nfunction svgText(x,y,s,color='#79828a',size=11){return '<text x=\"'+x+'\" y=\"'+y+'\" fill=\"'+color+'\" font-size=\"'+size+'\">'+s+'</text>'}\nfunction linePath(a,lo,hi,top=22,height=125){return a.map((v,i)=>(i?'L':'M')+(48+i/Math.max(1,a.length-1)*636).toFixed(1)+' '+(top+(hi-v)/(hi-lo)*height).toFixed(1)).join('')}\nfunction curve(a,lo,hi,color,top=22,height=125){return '<path d=\"'+linePath(a,lo,hi,top,height)+'\" stroke=\"'+color+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>'}\nfunction chartGrid(lo,hi,label){let s=svgText(48,13,label,'#4d565b');for(let k=0;k<3;k++){let y=22+k*62.5;s+='<line x1=\"48\" y1=\"'+y+'\" x2=\"684\" y2=\"'+y+'\" stroke=\"#e9e5dc\"/>'+svgText(3,y+4,(hi-(hi-lo)*k/2).toFixed(1))}return s}\nlet sampleIndex=0,well=null,result=null,pending=0,selected={x:Math.floor(SPEC.w*.55),y:Math.floor(SPEC.h*.55)};\nfunction refresh(){let n=+$('noise').value,p=+$('param').value;$('out-noise').textContent=n.toFixed(2);$('out-param').textContent=SPEC.percent?(p*100).toFixed(0)+'%':p.toFixed(SPEC.digits??2);$('sample-name').textContent='独立合成'+SPEC.sample+' '+String(sampleIndex+1).padStart(3,'0')+' · 种子 '+well.seed;result=compute(well,n,p);render();inspect()}\nfunction flush(){if(pending){cancelAnimationFrame(pending);pending=0}refresh()}\nfunction schedule(){if(!pending)pending=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{pending=0;refresh()})}\nfunction initialize(){well=makeWell(12031);for(let id of ['noise','param']){$(id).addEventListener('input',schedule);$(id).addEventListener('change',flush)}$('new-sample').addEventListener('click',()=>{well=makeWell(12031+7919*++sampleIndex);flush()});$('reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{sampleIndex=0;well=makeWell(12031);$('noise').value=SPEC.noise;$('param').value=SPEC.value;selected={x:Math.floor(SPEC.w*.55),y:Math.floor(SPEC.h*.55)};flush()});for(let id of ['raw-image','mask-image'])$(id).addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$(id).getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*CW,y=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*CH;selected={x:Math.floor(clamp((x-OX)/PW*SPEC.w,0,SPEC.w-1)),y:Math.floor(clamp((y-OY)/PH*SPEC.h,0,SPEC.h-1))};render();inspect()});$('view-mode').addEventListener('change',()=>{render();inspect()});$('point-x').max=SPEC.w-1;$('point-y').max=SPEC.h-1;for(let id of ['point-x','point-y'])$(id).addEventListener('input',()=>{selected={x:+$('point-x').value,y:+$('point-y').value};render();inspect()});$('export').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(pending)flush();let c=csvRows(),quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[c.head,...c.rows].map(r=>r.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download=SPEC.key+'-'+well.seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)});refresh()}\nfunction position(){let i=selected.y*SPEC.w+selected.x;$('point-x').value=selected.x;$('point-y').value=selected.y;$('point-location').textContent='('+selected.x+', '+selected.y+')';return i}\n\nfunction makeWell(seed){let r=rng(seed),angle=25+r()*55,lines=[{angle,rho:-18},{angle,rho:1},{angle,rho:20},{angle:(angle+65)%180,rho:-6}],truth=[],raw=[],noise=[];for(let y=0;y<SPEC.h;y++)for(let x=0;x<SPEC.w;x++){let hit=lines.some(l=>Math.abs((x-(SPEC.w-1)/2)*Math.cos(l.angle*Math.PI/180)+(y-(SPEC.h-1)/2)*Math.sin(l.angle*Math.PI/180)-l.rho)<.65);truth.push(+hit);raw.push((hit?.18:.75)+.035*Math.sin(x/7)*Math.sin(y/5));noise.push(r()+r()-1)}return{seed,truth,raw,noise,lines}}\nfunction pixels(w,nl){return w.raw.map((v,i)=>clamp(v+w.noise[i]*nl*.55,0,1))}\nfunction feature(a,x,y){let at=(dx,dy)=>a[clamp(y+dy,0,SPEC.h-1)*SPEC.w+clamp(x+dx,0,SPEC.w-1)],v=at(0,0),background=avg([at(-3,0),at(3,0),at(0,-3),at(0,3)]);return[1,1-v,Math.max(0,background-v)]}\nconst training=(()=>{let a=[];for(let k=0;k<4;k++){let w=makeWell(9401+k*131),image=pixels(w,.35),r=rng(100+k),count=[0,0];while(count[0]<200||count[1]<200){let x=3+Math.floor(r()*(SPEC.w-6)),y=3+Math.floor(r()*(SPEC.h-6)),label=w.truth[y*SPEC.w+x];if(count[label]>=200)continue;count[label]++;a.push({x:feature(image,x,y),y:label})}}return a})();\nconst model=(()=>{let w=[0,0,0];for(let t=0;t<400;t++){let g=[0,0,0];for(let d of training){let p=1/(1+Math.exp(-d.x.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+v*w[j],0)));for(let j=0;j<3;j++)g[j]+=(p-d.y)*d.x[j]}w=w.map((v,j)=>v-.3*(g[j]/training.length+(j?.001*v:0)))}return w})();\nfunction clipLine(angle,rho){let a=angle*Math.PI/180,c=Math.cos(a),s=Math.sin(a),cx=(SPEC.w-1)/2,cy=(SPEC.h-1)/2,points=[];if(Math.abs(s)>1e-7)for(let x of [0,SPEC.w-1]){let y=cy+(rho-(x-cx)*c)/s;if(y>=0&&y<=SPEC.h-1)points.push([x,y])}if(Math.abs(c)>1e-7)for(let y of [0,SPEC.h-1]){let x=cx+(rho-(y-cy)*s)/c;if(x>=0&&x<=SPEC.w-1)points.push([x,y])}points=points.filter((p,i)=>!points.slice(0,i).some(q=>Math.hypot(p[0]-q[0],p[1]-q[1])<1e-5));return points.length>=2?points.slice(0,2):null}\nfunction hough(mask){let coordinates=[];mask.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v)coordinates.push([i%SPEC.w-(SPEC.w-1)/2,Math.floor(i/SPEC.w)-(SPEC.h-1)/2])});let candidates=[];for(let angle=0;angle<180;angle+=2){let a=angle*Math.PI/180,bins=new Uint16Array(130);for(let [x,y]of coordinates){let j=Math.round(x*Math.cos(a)+y*Math.sin(a))+65;if(j>=0&&j<130)bins[j]++}for(let j=0;j<130;j++)if(bins[j]>=24)candidates.push({angle,rho:j-65,votes:bins[j]})}candidates.sort((a,b)=>b.votes-a.votes);let lines=[];for(let q of candidates){if(lines.some(l=>{let diff=Math.abs(l.angle-q.angle);return diff<10&&Math.abs(l.rho-q.rho)<5||diff>170&&Math.abs(l.rho+q.rho)<5}))continue;let endpoints=clipLine(q.angle,q.rho);if(!endpoints)continue;lines.push({...q,endpoints,trace:(q.angle+90)%180,length:Math.hypot(endpoints[0][0]-endpoints[1][0],endpoints[0][1]-endpoints[1][1])*SPEC.scale});if(lines.length>=10)break}return lines}\nfunction compute(w,nl,threshold){let raw=pixels(w,nl),scores=raw.map((v,i)=>1/(1+Math.exp(-feature(raw,i%SPEC.w,Math.floor(i/SPEC.w)).reduce((s,v,j)=>s+v*model[j],0)))),pred=scores.map(v=>+(v>=threshold)),base=raw.map(v=>+(v<.35)),lines=hough(pred),rose=Array(12).fill(0);for(let l of lines)rose[Math.min(11,Math.floor(l.trace/15))]+=l.length;return{raw,scores,pred,base,lines,rose,stats:f1(pred,w.truth),baseline:f1(base,w.truth)}}\nfunction render(){let d=result;plot('raw-image',i=>rgb([d.raw[i],d.raw[i],d.raw[i]]));let g=plot('mask-image',outputColor);if($('view-mode').value==='pred'){g.strokeStyle='#b26a39';g.lineWidth=1.6;for(let l of d.lines){g.beginPath();g.moveTo(OX+(l.endpoints[0][0]+.5)*PW/SPEC.w,OY+(l.endpoints[0][1]+.5)*PH/SPEC.h);g.lineTo(OX+(l.endpoints[1][0]+.5)*PW/SPEC.w,OY+(l.endpoints[1][1]+.5)*PH/SPEC.h);g.stroke()}}let max=Math.max(1,...d.rose),cx=350,cy=90,r=65,s=svgText(48,14,'候选迹线方向玫瑰图：按裁剪线长加权、180° 对称');for(let rr of [22,44,65])s+='<circle cx=\"'+cx+'\" cy=\"'+cy+'\" r=\"'+rr+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\"/>';for(let k=0;k<12;k++){let a=(k*15+7.5)*Math.PI/180,rad=d.rose[k]/max*r,x=rad*Math.cos(a),y=rad*Math.sin(a);s+='<path d=\"M'+(cx-x)+' '+(cy-y)+'L'+(cx+x)+' '+(cy+y)+'\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"9\" opacity=\".8\"/>'}s+=svgText(cx+80,cy+3,'0° → x')+svgText(cx-15,cy+82,'90° ↓ y')+svgText(48,190,'图像坐标的迹线角；未做相机姿态或露面标定，不是地质走向/倾角');$('diagnostic').innerHTML=s;metrics([['学习掩膜 F1',d.stats.f.toFixed(3)],['固定灰度 F1',d.baseline.f.toFixed(3)],['候选线数',String(d.lines.length)+(d.lines.length===10?'（上限）':'')],['二维迹线强度',(d.lines.reduce((s,l)=>s+l.length,0)/(SPEC.w*SPEC.h*SPEC.scale**2)).toFixed(2)+' m⁻¹']]);$('note').innerHTML='橙线来自预测掩膜的 Hough 投票，经邻近峰抑制并裁剪到露面。玫瑰图展示<b>图像迹线方向</b>，长度采用教学标尺 20 px/m；候选线数不等于真实节理条数，也不直接表示储层渗透率。';$('coefficients').innerHTML=table(['模型项','学习系数'],['截距','暗度','局部对比'].map((n,j)=>[n,model[j].toFixed(4)]))+table(['线号','图像角 °','投票','长度 m'],d.lines.map((l,k)=>[k+1,l.trace,l.votes,l.length.toFixed(2)]))+'<p>四幅训练图 / 1600 均衡像素，逻辑回归 400 轮；Hough 法向步长 2°、最低 24 票、最多 10 条。二维强度为候选线长总和/露面面积，依赖候选去重与标尺假设。</p>'}\nfunction inspect(){let i=position(),d=result,closest=d.lines.map(l=>({l,d:Math.abs((selected.x-(SPEC.w-1)/2)*Math.cos(l.angle*Math.PI/180)+(selected.y-(SPEC.h-1)/2)*Math.sin(l.angle*Math.PI/180)-l.rho)})).sort((a,b)=>a.d-b.d)[0];pointValues([['像素灰度',d.raw[i].toFixed(3)],['模型分数 / 阈值',d.scores[i].toFixed(3)+' / '+(+$('param').value).toFixed(2)],['真值 / 掩膜',well.truth[i]+' / '+d.pred[i]],['最近候选图像角',closest?closest.l.trace+'°，距 '+closest.d.toFixed(1)+' px':'无候选']],'候选线由图像本身评分与投票生成，测试真值只算分割 F1，没有提供角度或线数。交叉、阴影和纹理会造成重复或漏检；点离无限直线近并不保证属于同一裂缝。标尺假设仅用于二维迹线长度，不能据此求三维裂缝开度、天然属性或走向倾角。')}\nfunction csvRows(){let rows=result.raw.map((v,i)=>['pixel',well.seed,(i%SPEC.w)*SPEC.scale,Math.floor(i/SPEC.w)*SPEC.scale,v,result.scores[i],well.truth[i],result.pred[i],'','','','','','','']);result.lines.forEach((l,k)=>rows.push(['line',well.seed,'','','','','','',k+1,l.trace,l.votes,l.length,JSON.stringify(l.endpoints),l.rho,l.angle]));return{head:['record_type','sample_seed','x_m','y_m','gray','score','truth_mask','predicted_mask','line_id','image_trace_deg','hough_votes','clipped_length_m','endpoints_px','normal_rho_px','normal_angle_deg'],rows}}\ninitialize();\n\n})();"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){const host=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>host.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}